  "details": "I am in the process of getting away from Google. \n\nPart of this process is switching to a new email address and leaving Gmail.\n\nMy new email provider of choice ended up being Proton, I have switched all other applications and services I use to my new Proton email address. \n\nBut for some reason VRChat has Proton emails blocked.\n\nI looked around in the forums here as well as the VRChat Discord server and found that many people have been complaining about this since 2020.\n\nThere is no legitimate reason to be blocking Proton, as it is one of the most secure email providers out there, and it certainly isn't any easier to create new accounts there than it is on Gmail for example.\n\nI saw one response from a moderator on one of the old posts from 2020 on here, in which the moderator's in question tone appeared quite aggressive. \n\nIs there some personal tension between the VRChat team and Proton?",
